{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:oriented-unit-normal","title":"def:oriented-unit-normal","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1859,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:oriented-unit-normal","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:oriented-unit-normal","line":3035,"source":"\\begin{definition}[A Unit Normal Inducing a Given Orientation]\n\\label{def:oriented-unit-normal}\n\n\\uses{def:unit-normal, def:interior-multiplication, def:induced-orientation, lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation}\n\n\n\n\nA unit normal $w$ at $x$ \\emph{induces} a pointwise orientation $o(x)$ if $((w\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x(b)>0$ for every basis $b$ positively oriented for $o(x)$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[A Unit Normal Inducing a Given Orientation] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6f7269656e7465642d756e69742d6e6f726d616c\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aunit-normal\">↗ def:unit-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anonvanishing-top-form-orientation\">↗ lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation</a> <p></p>A unit normal <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$w$\">$w$</span> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span> <em>induces</em> a pointwise orientation <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$o(x)$\">$o(x)$</span> if <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$((w\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x(b)&gt;0$\">$((w\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x(b)&gt;0$</span> for every basis <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$b$\">$b$</span> positively oriented for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$o(x)$\">$o(x)$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:basis-realizing-orientation","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","label":"def:unit-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","title":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","label":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos","title":"lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos","label":"lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:existsunique-oriented-unit-normal","title":"prop:existsunique-oriented-unit-normal","label":"prop:existsunique-oriented-unit-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal-of-orientation","title":"def:unit-normal-of-orientation","label":"def:unit-normal-of-orientation"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:oriented-unit-normal","title":"def:oriented-unit-normal","tex":"\\begin{definition}[A Unit Normal Inducing a Given Orientation]\n\\label{def:oriented-unit-normal}\n\n\\uses{def:unit-normal, def:interior-multiplication, def:induced-orientation, lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation}\n\n\n\n\nA unit normal $w$ at $x$ \\emph{induces} a pointwise orientation $o(x)$ if $((w\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x(b)>0$ for every basis $b$ positively oriented for $o(x)$.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","title":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}